{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲航天局（ESA）「赫拉」（Hera）探測器近日傳回了其抵達雙小行星系統後的首張近距離照片，首次以高解像度視角展示了「迪迪莫斯」（Didymos）小行星此前從未被詳細觀測過的一側地貌。科學家表示，這片區域呈現出的景觀與人們此前認知存在明顯差異，令人感到仿佛發現了一個全新的世界。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586954.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.337382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:03:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_hash":"e4b4c4c3f4c8de6f926dba807ec5a3b79115233c9175dd843726fa11aa6fa941","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}